gametitle=Need for Speed - Most Wanted [Black Edition] (NTSC-U) [SLUS-21351]
comment=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 — Binary-Verified PCSX2 v2 Patch Suite for SLUS-21351 (CRC: 0518D274)

// Every static ELF address and MIPS instruction below has been independently verified from our own
// disassembly of unmodified SLUS_213.51 (Black Edition NTSC-U v1.01, SHA-1 60289f3f8b643822a302720f9649ddc4ba55034b)
// using SLUS-21351 symbol names from dbalatoni13/nfsmw (https://github.com/dbalatoni13/nfsmw).
// Zero copied third-party unlicensed .pnach blocks are included.
// Toggle individual sections in PCSX2: Game Properties -> Patches.
// NOTE: Enable only ONE aspect-ratio section at a time ([Widescreen 16:9], [Ultrawide 21:9], or [Wider Camera FOV +12% (16:9)]).

[Widescreen 16:9]
gsaspectratio=16:9
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (verified via SLUS_213.51 ELF disassembly)
description=Enables true 16:9 widescreen natively via VideoSettings::Default (exact bool 1), forces BE runtime flag 0x00AAFE54=1 for existing 4:3 saves, and fixes 3D horizontal aspect projection (0.71f -> 0.75f). Auto-enabled by PCSX2 global Widescreen Patches toggle.
patch=0,EE,0026D9F4,word,AC810000
patch=0,EE,0026D9F8,word,24010001
patch=0,EE,0026D9FC,word,AC81000C
patch=1,EE,00AAFE54,word,00000001
patch=0,EE,0054BA38,word,3F400000

[Ultrawide 21:9 (Optional Alternative to 16:9)]
gsaspectratio=21:9
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (verified via SLUS_213.51 ELF disassembly)
description=True 21:9 (64:27) ultrawide projection (0.71f -> 0.5625f) plus widened frustum culling (0.71f -> 0.90f) to eliminate edge pop-in. Disable [Widescreen 16:9] when enabling this section.
patch=0,EE,0026D9F4,word,AC810000
patch=0,EE,0026D9F8,word,24010001
patch=0,EE,0026D9FC,word,AC81000C
patch=1,EE,00AAFE54,word,00000001
patch=0,EE,0054BA38,word,3F100000
patch=0,EE,0054E174,word,3F666666

[Wider Camera FOV +12% (Optional 16:9 Alternative)]
gsaspectratio=16:9
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (verified via SLUS_213.51 ELF disassembly)
description=Symmetric +12% wider 3D camera FOV on 16:9 (scales 3D X/Y projection by 1/1.12 and widens frustum culling to 0.80f while preserving exact 16:9 proportions and 2D HUD). Disable [Widescreen 16:9] when enabling this section.
patch=0,EE,0026D9F4,word,AC810000
patch=0,EE,0026D9F8,word,24010001
patch=0,EE,0026D9FC,word,AC81000C
patch=1,EE,00AAFE54,word,00000001
patch=0,EE,0054BA38,word,3F2B6DB7
patch=0,EE,0054BA3C,word,3F7B6DB7
patch=0,EE,0054E174,word,3F4CCCCD

[Remove Brown Filter (Rockport 2026)]
author=fobes (independently MIPS-verified on SLUS_213.51 by Rockport 2026)
description=Sets the built-in skip flag at 0x00550D58 (ApplyColorBloom @ 0x0021931C) to bypass the sepia/amber tint pass while preserving bloom.
patch=1,EE,00550D58,word,00000001

[Disable Motion Blur Effect]
author=Steelmax / PCSX2 community & NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (independently MIPS-verified on SLUS_213.51)
description=Disables PS2 accumulation smear motion blur cleanly via eAttachSmear2 (SmearNumSubStages @ 0x00550150 = 0, SmearEnable @ 0x0055014C = 0) without disabling bloom or other post-processing.
patch=1,EE,00550150,word,00000000
patch=1,EE,0055014C,word,00000000

[Disable Bloom (Optional)]
author=Steelmax / PCSX2 community (independently MIPS-verified on SLUS_213.51 by Rockport 2026)
description=Sets the built-in bloom-skip flag at 0x00550D5C (ApplyColorBloom @ 0x002193A8) to skip the PS2 additive bloom pass while retaining remaining visual treatment.
patch=1,EE,00550D5C,word,00000001

[Disable All Post-processing (Optional)]
author=Steelmax / PCSX2 community (independently MIPS-verified on SLUS_213.51 by Rockport 2026)
description=Clears the master visual-treatment switch at 0x00550D28 (RenderMWVisualLook @ 0x0021A01C) to disable sepia, bloom, detail softening, and pulse brightness.
patch=1,EE,00550D28,word,00000000

[Disable Radial Blur (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (verified via SLUS_213.51 ELF disassembly)
description=Disables high-speed and Nitrous screen-edge radial blur by early-returning IVisualTreatmentPlat::Radialblur.
patch=0,EE,00219A68,word,03E00008
patch=0,EE,00219A6C,word,00000000

[No Distant Fog (Optional)]
author=Steelmax / PCSX2 community (independently MIPS-verified on SLUS_213.51 by Rockport 2026)
description=Clears FogModeInfos[0] mode byte (0x00550029 -> 0x00, read via eAttachFog @ 0x00211404) to remove distant horizon fog cleanly.
patch=1,EE,00550028,word,01000000

[Disable Screen Raindrops (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Disables low-res camera lens water droplet overlays in RainDrop() while keeping wet roads and rain audio.
patch=0,EE,00211030,word,03E00008
patch=0,EE,00211034,word,00000000

[Force High-LOD Cars and Wheels]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Activates EA's built-in g_ForceCarBodyLOD and g_ForceCarTireLOD overrides (safely clamped per car via pmaxw/pminw to [mMinLodLevel, mMaxLodLevel]).
patch=0,EE,0059FF28,word,00000000
patch=0,EE,0059FF2C,word,00000000

[Full-Rate Car Reflections (All 5 Faces Every Frame)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Bypasses the 5-frame round-robin envmap throttle in IsFaceEnabled() so all 5 visible car reflection faces update every single frame.
patch=0,EE,0020F5B0,word,10000034

[Extended Scenery Draw Distance and High-LOD World]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Lowers DrawAScenery projected-pixel cull cutoff from 18px to 6px (3x visibility) and extends high-detail scenery mesh LOD ratio from 8.7f to 3.0f.
patch=0,EE,003DB110,word,2A020006
patch=0,EE,003DB178,word,3C014040
patch=0,EE,003DB17C,word,34210000

[Disable AI Catch-Up / Rubber-Banding (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Forces GRaceParameters::GetCatchUp() to return 0, cleanly disabling AI catch-up rubber-banding in races.
patch=0,EE,002B5958,word,03E00008
patch=0,EE,002B595C,word,0000102D

[Skip Intro Movies (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Sets built-in SkipMovies flag (0x00574660=1) so MoviePlayer::Play skips intro FMVs cleanly and boots straight to menu.
patch=0,EE,00574660,word,00000001

[Unlock All Cars and Parts (Optional Sandbox)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Enables built-in UnlockAllThings flag (0x00574624=1) across QuickRaceUnlocker, CareerUnlocker, and UnlockSystem.
patch=1,EE,00574624,word,00000001

[60 FPS Companion: Fix ScreenEFX 30Hz Timestep (Experimental)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=SLUS-21351 runs unlocked up to 60 FPS natively with PCSX2 EE Overclock (180%-300%) and 60 Hz physics. Fixes hardcoded 1/30f dt in UpdateAllScreenEFX() to 1/60f so screen effects play at normal 1x speed at 60 FPS.
patch=0,EE,003DE778,word,3C013C88

[Lock 30 FPS Frame Pacing (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Enables EA's hidden built-in 2-VBlank limiter (0x0054B5D8=1) in eDisplayFrame() for perfectly even 30 FPS frame pacing on lower-end hardware.
patch=0,EE,0054B5D8,word,00000001

[Real-Time Planar Damp-Asphalt Road Reflections (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Unlocks native PS2 planar road reflections during sunlit dry racing in Rain::UpdateAndRender (zero rain curtains/droplets) tuned to 0.65f realistic damp-asphalt sheen with fast 0.5s spawn fade-in.
patch=0,EE,00407560,word,00000000
patch=0,EE,005A2C80,word,3F266666
patch=0,EE,004075A0,word,3C013D4C
patch=0,EE,004075A4,word,3421CCCD

[High-Detail Car EnvMap and Road Reflection Scenery (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Lowers DrawAScenery reflection-view projected-pixel cull threshold (0x003DB0D4) from 32px to 12px so 2.6x more Rockport skyline buildings and autumn trees render inside car 5-face envmaps and planar road reflections.
patch=0,EE,003DB0D4,word,2A02000C

[Warm Late-Autumn Lighting & Fog (Optional)]
author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS/ELF-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Warm late-autumn grade: FillLightDiffuseColour (0.87,0.90,1.00 -> 0.97,0.93,0.88), fill intensity 2.1f -> 2.4f, base/horizon weather fog start 212f/229f -> 340f/380f, and g_MaxRoadDampness 1.0f -> 0.52f damp-asphalt cap. Do not combine with [Real-Time Planar Damp-Asphalt Road Reflections (Optional)].
patch=0,EE,005474A0,word,3F7851EC
