author=NFSMW: Rockport 2026 (MIPS/ELF-verified for SLUS-21351)
description=Golden-hour v2.8 rebalance: boosts PrimaryLightDiffuseIntensity (6.5f -> 8.8f) over luminous sky FillLightDiffuse (2.1f -> 2.15f, [0.88,0.905,0.96]) for crisp 4.09:1 3D depth without dark-wall crush, clears mid-fog (340f/380f), and unlocks planar road reflections capped at g_MaxRoadDampness=0.58f. Do not combine with [Real-Time Planar Damp-Asphalt Road Reflections (Optional)] or [Warm Late-Autumn Lighting & Fog (Optional)].
